message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
type: article
title: "当执行趋于无限：人工智能时代的组织形态"
abstract: >-
  Cognitive execution is being commoditized. This paper asks what remains for an
  organization to allocate when execution becomes effectively free, and answers with
  a design claim: organizations should treat judgment as the object of allocation and
  attach every autonomous action chain to a subject that can be named.
